flowchart TD
    subgraph R1["前半程（system_server 内）"]
        direction LR
        HW["触摸屏硬件"] --> EV["内核 evdev 驱动<br/>/dev/input/eventX"]
        EV --> EH["EventHub<br/>epoll 监听 + 热插拔"]
        EH --> IR["InputReader 线程<br/>原始事件 → MotionEvent"]
        IR --> ID["InputDispatcher 线程<br/>决策派发 + ANR 计时"]
    end
    subgraph R2["后半程（跨进程送达 App）"]
        direction LR
        IC["InputChannel<br/>socketpair"] --> RECV["NativeInputEventReceiver<br/>epoll 唤醒"]
        RECV --> APP["ViewRootImpl 收到 → 15 篇分发"]
    end
    R1 ==> R2
    NOTE["三个角色都是 system_server 内的 native 线程（00 篇误区）"] -.-> R1
